  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Confidential is a high-performance shaped co-polyester string engineered to deliver a refined balance of power, control, spin, feel and comfort. Its innovative chemical composition works with a high-powered polyester monofilament fiber to generate strong ball bite and spin while maintaining precise directional control and improved tension stability. Compared with more spin-dominant Solinco offerings, Confidential places greater emphasis on feedback, consistency and controlled power.",

    "zh": "Solinco Confidential 是一款高性能异形共聚酯球线，核心定位是在力量、控制、旋转、手感和舒适性之间取得更精细的平衡。创新化学配方与高性能聚酯单丝结合，能够提供强咬球和高旋转，同时保持精准方向控制与优秀保磅表现。相比更加偏旋转导向的 Hyper-G，Confidential 更强调稳定反馈、精确控制以及可预测的力量输出。"
  },

